Subject: d3d11: route wrapped Texture2D ownership through Relay12

Hybrid D3D12 callers pass their existing textures to ID3D11On12Device. The
frontend previously rejected creation and silently ignored acquire/release.
Allocate the public texture shell before publishing its address-bound core
handle, retain it through the existing backend child lifetime, and route
validated ownership batches to the original caller queue. Reject foreign
frontend resources before interpreting their internal storage.
